msgstr "Please, check the configuration"

#: inc/secret.class.php:130
msgid "Hi,"
msgstr "Hallo"

#: inc/secret.class.php:130
msgid ""
"As mentioned in our previous conversation, this message is meant to share "
"sensitive information with you."
msgstr ""
"Zoals vermeld in ons vorige gesprek, is dit bericht bedoeld om gevoelige "
"informatie met u te delen."

#: inc/secret.class.php:131
msgid ""
"A secret link <b>only works once</b> and <b>then disappears forever</b>. Do "
"not open it if you are not the intended recipient."
msgstr ""
"Een geheime link <b> werkt maar 1 keer </b> en <b>verdwijnt dan voor altijd "
"</b>.open dit niet als het niet voor u bedoeld is."

#: inc/secret.class.php:132
msgid "Here you have"
msgstr "Hier heb je"

#: inc/secret.class.php:133
msgid "your secret link"
msgstr "uw geheime link"

#: inc/secret.class.php:136
msgid ""
"I will send you the required passphrase to open it using an alternative "
"method for security reasons."
msgstr ""
"Om veiligheidsredenen stuur ik u de vereiste wachtwoordzin om te openen via "
"een alternatieve methode."

#: inc/secret.class.php:138
msgid "Bear in mind:"
msgstr "Hou rekening met:"

#: inc/secret.class.php:138
msgid "A secret link can only be opened once and will expire afterwards."
msgstr "Een geheime link kan maar één keer worden geopend en vervalt daarna."

#: inc/secret.class.php:139
#, php-format
msgid "This secret link will expire %1$s after its generation."
msgstr "Deze geheime link vervalt %1$s na het aanmaken ervan."

#: inc/secret.class.php:140
msgid "Regards,"
msgstr "Met vriendelijke groeten,"

